    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.77,
      351.13,
      539.65,
      374.2
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 3 and 4 of the Societies Ordinance (Chapter 123), I, RishadBathiudeen Minister of Industry and Commerce, do by this notification :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.09,
      387.13,
      539.96,
      422.2
    ],
    "text": "1.Authorize the purpose for which the Society known as \u201c Sri Saddhananda Daham Pasal Adi Shishya Sangamaya\u2019\u2019situated at Sri Saddhananda Daham Pasal Adi Shishya Sangamaya Paramadhamma Visuddharamaya, Katuwawala,Boralesgamuwa as a purpose to which the powers and facilities of that Ordinance ought to be extended ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.09,
      435.13,
      539.94,
      458.2
    ],
    "text": "2.Limit the application of that Ordinance to aforesaid society by exempting it from the provision ofSection 5 (4) of that Ordinance.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
